    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-10-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "、北朐国皆在郁水南。郁水出湘陵南海。一曰相虑。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "南海之外，赤水之西，流沙之东，有兽"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有阿山者。南海之中，有泛天之山，赤水穷焉。赤"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-16-21",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西南海之外，赤水之南，流沙之西，有人"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-09",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "南海之外，黑水青水之间，有木名曰若"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "soushenji-12-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "南海之外，有“鲛人”，水居，如鱼，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "soushenji-17-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "然。”去后，君谓士曰：“先来，南海君也。”士是书生，君明通五经，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "积石山。赤水出其东南陬，西南注南海丹泽之东。赤水之东，弱水出自穷"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
